WEBVTT

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:03.260
last episode of Dragon Ball Z.

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:05.120
The Nasty Cell Juniors

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:06.980
drove our heroes straight into the dirt.

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:09.020
Withstanding hit after brutal hit,

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:10.860
the powerful Z fighters were beaten

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:12.880
and broken, lying helpless under the hot

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.880
desert sun. Not even Piccolo

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:16.640
or the Super Saiyans could turn back

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:17.820
the dreadful attackers.

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.310
And with the hope of victory fading

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:27.430
fast, Goku began to realize

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:29.450
he'd been wrong about his son.

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:37.840
And through all the terror, Gohan watched.

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:45.060
Now take your anger and feed off of it before it's too late for your old friends.

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:48.360
Meanwhile, Hercule showed a sliver of courage

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:51.820
as he granted the bodyless 16's final plea

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:54.120
by throwing him into the fray

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:59.120
as the exploded android had some famous last words for the young boy.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.540
it's okay

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:06.380
I do know how you feel

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:08.060
Gohan but it is not a sin

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:09.720
to fight for the right cause

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:11.540
for there are those who words alone

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:12.640
will not reach

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:20.060
let it go

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:24.880
and then with one swift shattering step

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:26.950
Cell crushed Sixteen's head

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.930
right before Gohan's eyes

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:29.970
and the bright light

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:48.200
of the gentle android faded yet another fighter you could have saved before his demise 16 urged

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:54.340
gohan to protect all the life that he loved to let go of his restraints and fight and now he will

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:59.960
if there ever was a button to push cell has pressed it if there ever was a final wall in his way

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.980
Cell has knocked it down

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:04.040
For the kindness and Gohan has

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:05.960
Disappeared and the hidden

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:08.180
Power inside him has been unleashed

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:16.690
On Dragon Ball Z

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:53.690
He's sick of his energy.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:21.290
gone. So this is it, huh? You are repeating the same mistakes as Trunks, boy. Don't think you can

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:23.430
defeat me just by powering up.

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:04.590
Ah!

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.690
Boy, let it all out.

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:56.270
Leave a...

00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:06.730
This whole place is gonna blow!

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:57.150
I forgive you for what you've done, Sal.

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:07.560
Yaaaah!

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:45.180
Finally, you've come out of hiding. Now, my games will get really interesting.

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:50.180
No games!

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:55.820
But how did you- the Senzu beans! How did you get them?

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:23.680
The time we've spent trying to defeat these things, he does it in one blow!

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:26.480
Gohan, you're incredible!

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:32.840
I told you so.

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:00.590
But how?

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:02.050
He's so quick.

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:03.630
He did it right.

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:06.600
He increased his strength without losing his speed.

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:59.620
About me.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.760
Just do what you gotta do

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:06.970
I don't believe what I'm seeing!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:38.780
Chichi, oh good you're okay. Did anything happen to my darling Gohan? Please you've got to tell me

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:46.450
I don't know. He was increasing his power than the TV went on the fritz. Oh my brave little warrior

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:50.880
He's too young to be out there. He should be here at home studying

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:54.580
But no he had to listen to his father instead of me. Hey

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:59.980
Gohan is no longer a little baby. Why he surpassed

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:06.820
Goku and turned into an honorable warrior. I know it's hard for you to accept, but both your husband

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:13.350
and son are battling to save this entire planet. Without them, we're gone! If it were up to me,

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:19.820
I'd prefer it was me out there instead of him, but Gohan is our last hope. Come on, Chi Chi,

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:29.600
everything will be all right. Is that all? Or is there more preaching to come?

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:33.140
Huh? But Chi-Chi, huh?

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:42.520
Think I don't know my own son?

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:46.310
You think just by saving the Earth, he'll be able to get into a good school?

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:50.360
Then what, huh? You think he'll be able to find a decent job?

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.000
You're the one who doesn't have a clue!

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:55.900
Okay, Chi-Chi, just relax!

00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:58.520
You want me to relax?

00:12:59.350 --> 00:12:59.970
Someone else can-

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.140
and fight those stupid battles,

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:03.200
I don't want my son to be a hool again!

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:04.250
Goku!

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:07.360
You bring me back my baby right now!

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:08.080
Huh?

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:18.840
This is the power Goku was boasting about.

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:23.380
Hmm, well let's just see it against all five of them.

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:25.060
Ah!

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:55.810
watching me don't they understand i'm the real star of this show i'm the one who tossed that

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:58.670
guy's head over there this is all because of me

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:00.820
He could win!

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:02.900
I don't believe it!

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:09.680
Ladies and gentlemen, that brave little boy is fighting a valiant battle against a swarm of nasty little mini-cells!

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:12.750
Hey, would you keep it rolling, you red camasher?

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:15.120
But I can't. It's broken.

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.000
Well then, fix it.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:19.620
Do you realize we're missing the scoop of the century?!

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:36.450
Just blew all those creatures away with nothing but his energy and just look at him. He's totally calm

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:53.940
It's like he's not even warmed up yet, right? Yeah, you see told you so he's gonna do it piccolo

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:39.260
I said before I could never forgive you

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.000
What have you done?

00:18:37.036 --> 00:18:39.296
Nothing holding Gohan back now.

00:18:39.980 --> 00:18:43.460
He's finally able to tap into his power at will.

00:18:44.332 --> 00:18:46.172
Now it's time to pay, Cell.

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:49.360
You have to face up to your dreadful crimes!

00:18:49.836 --> 00:18:51.836
Oh

00:18:54.124 --> 00:18:55.324
These are round trunks.

00:18:59.340 --> 00:18:59.840
Huh?

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:01.060
Sure!

00:19:33.836 --> 00:19:39.796
So, the big question has finally been answered after releasing his incredible hidden power.

00:19:40.144 --> 00:19:45.424
Go hot and wipe down all seven of the Savage Cell Juniors without even breaking a sweat.

00:19:45.868 --> 00:19:48.748
But now, he's got bigger fish to fry.

00:19:49.388 --> 00:19:51.388
The mighty cell himself.

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:54.300
Are Goku's predictions correct?

00:19:54.732 --> 00:19:58.972
Can Gohan finally put an end to Cell and all of his agonizing games?

00:19:58.972 --> 00:19:59.972
And...

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:03.980
Has the role of Earth's protector been passed on from father to son?

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:10.610
The momentous battle begins next time on Dragon Ball Z.

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:15.920
Hey, everyone. This is Goku.

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:20.380
All the people on Earth are still waiting to find out who's going to win the battle with Cell.

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:22.040
And they won't have to wait much longer.

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:24.670
Their last hope is up and back, and it's my son.

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:27.010
So far, everyone else has struck out.

00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:29.920
So if Gohan doesn't come through, well, neither will Earth.

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:33.730
So make sure to tune in for the drama next time on Dragon Ball Z.
